    {
      "Id": 2006608025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我明明都明白……！一想到也许以后不能继续待在这里，/n我就害怕得迈不出那一步……！",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "太难看了……！明明一直把“为了大家”挂在嘴边，我却！/n难道因为舍不得自己，就要把大家和自己的信念都撇到一边吗……！！",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……嗯。我无法改变自己的处世方式。/n我做不到为了保全自己，就把那些正在困扰的人弃之不顾。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1840",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 2,
      "SeFileName": "641",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（那一天，您想着其他演员而流下的泪，/n　以及今天公开表明的意志）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080280",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "SpineId": 30101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（我明明亲眼看着这些，却只能选择视而不见。/n　总是这样……我总摆出一副了不起的样子，说自己是剧团门面）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080290",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 73,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（实际上却什么也做不到。和伊吕波那次一样。/n　果然，我……还是）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080300",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我们建立起来的传统……你说什么？",
      "BgmFileName": "999",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座上层A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……！？老师，怎么了吗？/n是有什么问题……？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "问题？当然有问题。一直以来，从以前开始就全是问题。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "时代会变化，这是世间常理。/n传统的价值，并不在于一味维持原状。",
      "BgmFileName": "201",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080340",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哪怕被变化的时代洪流冲击，也要守住永远不会崩塌的不变轴心。/n并始终如一地继续照亮人们的心，这才是传统真正的价值。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080350",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "若只执着于维持，最终只会走向停滞。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080360",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这种事，在我们开始积极从海外招募演员时，/n我还以为你们早就明白了？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080370",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 39,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "连如今剧团所处的形势都不了解的无知之人，/n为什么还能站在这里参与讨论？这才真是荒唐至极。",
