    {
      "Id": 2006608042,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 42,
      "SpeakerName": "前剧团成员A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "您明白自己在说什么吗？/n我们正是作为银河传统的继承者才站在这里。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080410",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608043,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 43,
      "SpeakerName": "前剧团成员B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就、就是啊。拉莫娜·沃尔芙的做法，/n确实扰乱了剧团秩序吧，老师！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080420",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608044,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 44,
      "SpeakerName": "前剧团成员C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "恕我直言，您真的明白自己在说什么吗！？/n作为银河座的传统，那种演员本就不应被允许，老师您也知道——",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080430",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608045,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 45,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你们几个，是在向我解释传统吗？/n向从很早以前就一直身在这个剧团的我？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080440",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608046,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 46,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过是多混了几年资历，别就得意忘形了，小丫头。/n你以为自己是在谁打造的舞台上才出了这么大的名？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080450",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608047,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 47,
      "SpeakerName": "前剧团成员们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……！！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080460",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608048,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 48,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "什……这是……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080470",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 5,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30101,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
