      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608058,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 58,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "您替我说话了。/n如果没有那番话，我现在恐怕已经不得不收拾行李了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080560",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608059,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 59,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不必在意。/n我只是把一直以来都在思考的事情说出来而已。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080570",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608060,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 60,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "《圆桌骑士物语》非常精彩。/n你成功演完了一个夹在责任与私人情感之间受尽折磨的王。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080580",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608061,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 61,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "运营方或许也有意把当时你的处境，/n与王国走向瓦解的亚瑟重叠起来……但完成度超出了预想。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080590",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608062,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 62,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "果然，你拥有足以被树立为/n我所设想计划旗帜的实力。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080600",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608063,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 63,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "旗帜……？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080610",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608064,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 64,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是的。自从以你为首的海外演员被招进来以后，/n这个剧团开始显现变化。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080620",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608065,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 65,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而这份变化不能被断绝。/n我认为，这是银河座所需要的变化。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080630",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608066,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 66,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座高层",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "所以，为了把这种变化也纳入传统之中，/n我正在计划成立一个与银河一脉相连的新剧团。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080640",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006608067,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006608,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 67,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "与银河一脉相连……新的剧团……？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20066080650",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
